x86_64-windows  a member of a local class whose signature names a sibling local class spells the enclosing function again inside that class's ?1? scope, where cl and clang back-reference it (`?1??2@YAH0@Z@`): the difference local-class-member-access.nonames records, cxx1 not carrying the function's back-references into its local entities. Local names nothing outside the unit links against; the Itanium targets agree on all.
